Help provides help for any command in the application.
Simply type flate help [path to command] for full details.

Usage:
  flate help [command] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for help

Global Flags:
      --log-level string   Set log level: debug,info,warn,error [env: FLATE_LOG_LEVEL] (default "error")
      --no-progress        Hide live progress on stderr [env: FLATE_NO_PROGRESS]
